0 // Source 111 rigid parts plus one approved schematic cord represented by one straight segment.
0 // P6-P9 native 24/48/48/24 LDU rungs bridge the red rail faces with no lateral compensation.
0 // Hook moved to the inner axle end; one straight schematic cord joins the pulley groove and hook eye through the central opening.
0 // Each half-ladder is opened 2 degrees farther about the original shared hinge axis for a 64-degree static clearance pose.
0 // Static digital checks only; no physical retention, load, folding-motion validation, human confirmation or publication.
